# Licences

Every tool, library, and runtime dependency must be MIT or Apache-2.0.

- Do not add GPL, proprietary, or any other licence.
- If a needed library is not MIT or Apache-2.0, pick an MIT or Apache-2.0 alternative, or ask before adding it.
- Record the licence choice when a new dependency is added.
